{% comment %} {% include '~~/Assets/Lava/Custom/Blocks/fifty-fifty-homepage.lava' %} {% endcomment %}

<div class="row row-no-gutters d-flex flex-wrap">
    <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 bg-chevron-blue">
        <div class="container py-md-3 py-0" style="max-width: fit-content;">
            <div class="px-3 py-5 my-md-5 px-md-0 mx-0 my-0 mx-md-5 text-white">
                <h2 class="h1">WHAT IS THE ADVANTAGE?</h2>
                <div style="max-width:650px;">
                    <p>Church leaders in lifegiving relationship, collaborating to reach the 8 million people in Pennsylvania who have no church home.</p>
                    <p class="o-80">If you’ve ever thought, “Am I the only one struggling to figure this out?” You’re not. We can figure it out together.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 bg-chevrons-orange">
        <div class="container py-md-3 py-0" style="max-width: fit-content;">
            <div class="px-3 py-5 my-md-5 px-md-0 mx-0 my-0 mx-md-5">
                <h2 class="h1">WHY WE EXIST</h2>
                <div style="max-width:650px;">
                    <p>In Acts 18:27, Apollos proved to be a great benefit (or ADVANTAGE) to those who had believed. As the name implies, our heart is to be an advantage to church leaders across Pennsylvania.</p>
                    <p class="o-80">We want to help you move beyond surviving, to thriving in your pastoral leadership.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
